>>
Rule 1 (input tensor must have a numeric, non-complex dtype: indices 1–8)
{v_1: tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8
>>
Rule 2 (no negative dimensions in the input tensor’s shape)
{v_1: tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : 0 ≤ shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 3 (reject unsupported non-numeric dtypes: string or dtype objects)
{v_1: tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 11 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 12 then false
